            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "princessjina1018"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family love these cookies! Instead of using shortening I use melted butter, and instead of sugar I use maple syrup which does make them really flat at first, but I add 1/2 tablespoon more of baking soda then wait for it to chill and cool off the butter in the cookies.",
            "datePublished": "2024-06-01T18:57:04.153Z"
          },
          {
