            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Barbara"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are just like the recipe I grew up with. Mom had lots of ways to make these:\n\nAdd fresh orange zest and substitute OJ for 1/4 c of the liquid.\nUse brown sugar instead of white.\nAdd chocolate or butterscotch chips (or both).\nMake larger cookies and use as shortcake with strawberries.",
            "datePublished": "2015-12-19T19:09:53.267Z"
          },
