            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sshirleyks"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was looking for the recipe for my grandmother's soft raisin cookies. This recipe was the closest I've come. I made it as written and added 1/2 tsp cinnamon and 1 cup of raisins. I did not add topping. It is delightfully cake-like. Very tender and not too sweet. Just right. Thank you.",
            "datePublished": "2019-07-21T02:02:13.157Z"
